libmorpheus data acquisition tool
Copyright (C) 2026 Antoine Boquet

This package is licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License version 3
or later. It contains a command-line tool and JavaScript library that download
pinned Morpheus stem datasets from their upstream repositories, verify them and
prepare them for the libmorpheus runtime. It does not contain any linguistic
stem-library data, nor the libmorpheus runtime. Its internal experimental
generation preparer includes MPL-2.0 Morpheus code compiled with the
MIT-licensed Emscripten runtime. The corresponding texts are under LICENSES/.

The datasets the tool acquires are mixed-license works distributed by their
upstream projects under their own terms; the tool preserves each upstream
license text next to the data it writes. Consult the libmorpheus provenance
and redistribution documentation before republishing acquired data.
